title Cassette Bluetooth (T4, synthetic names): recording from a headset that sends exact zeros: "The headset is connected but sends no sound." in the notice place
sizes 320x480 480x320 480x800 640x480 800x480 480x480 720x720
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO recording
env CASSETTE_DEMO_BT nosound
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
expect text "The headset is connected but sends no sound."
shot rec-nosound
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
